include fixture.praat
# THE SPAGHETTI PLOT. The pen is the STRAND's; the mean overlay stays solid, so that the summary a reader is asked to trust is not drawn in the same broken line as the individuals it summarises.
# SOLID, the control: the same figure, same data, same axis, differing from
# the case beside it in one option.
@lsSetType: 13
spLineStyle = 1
@lsPress
@lsReport: 1
@lsSave
